    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Creepy Yet Weirdly Cute &quot;Oji&quot; Are Coming for You!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive horde of ridiculously adorable old dudes is out to get you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If they touch the protagonist\u2014an unimpressive salaryman\u2014he might just transform into an ultra-cute &quot;Oji&quot; himself...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But why are they attacking? And why do they look exactly like him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery behind these bizarre yet lovable &quot;Oji&quot; as you progress through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Mow Down the Oji Swarm with the Ultimate Power Build \u2013 A Thrill Ride of Action &amp; Domination</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheer despair of being completely surrounded by an army of Oji...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the absolute <i>rush</i> when you manage to break through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to mention the godlike power you feel when you complete the ultimate build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From self-destructing mine-type Oji to rare Oji that flee from the player\u2014each enemy has unique behavior patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need quick reflexes and sharp decision-making to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Spin That Slot! A Real-Time Deck-Building System Like No Other</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike legendary action games like <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Brotato</i>, deck-building in this game happens in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action never stops\u2014no pausing, no breathers, just pure chaos for 15 minutes straight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, attack, spin the slot, and strategize your build\u2014all at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game designed for those who <i>thrive</i> in overtasked madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(And yeah... maybe I\u2019m one of them too.)</p>",
